Z||000000||NOS3800||12-31-2001||12:16 AM||||On my way home from my GF's house I ran across a white 86-87 GT. It was around 11pm on 301. We had some fun racing back and forth even though my car was feeling rather slugish for some reason. I was just curious if were on the list. I moticed you had a Mid Atlantic Fiero Owners Assoc. sticker in your rear window. <BR>Also, sweet backfire! Flame shot out of your exhaust! Also, you had me off the line at that light! Yours really launches well!<P>------------------<BR>Purple 1988 GT<BR>NOS injected 3800 Series II V6<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sig_Pic,_nos3800_3.jpg"> <BR>Best ET(75 shot)-13.21@102.13 mph<BR>w/o NOS 14.86@92.06mph||||reg||5
